in the Legend of Zelda breath of the  wild you start your adventure with  nothing but an old shirt and well-worn  trousers but as you progress there are  plenty of armor sets to find that offer  more useful bonuses than just an  increase to your defense whether it's a  boost to your attack or climbing speed  there are a multitude of sets that stand  apart from the rest  that's why we've compiled our picks of  the best armor sets available for more  on where to find the armor we highlight  in this video check out the link in the  description below and if you enjoyed  this video like it and subscribe to our  YouTube channel for more features on  breath of the wild and be sure to watch  our video on how to defeat all of the  game's mini bosses the climbers armor is  the most advantageous set in the game as  each of its individual parts drastically  increase your climbing speed combined  wearing the set with the speed enhancing  elixir of food and you'll be clamoring  to the top of the mountain in no time in  addition if you upgrade each of its  pieces twice the stamina consumed by  your climbing jump decreases  [Music]  the Barbarian Armour set is helpful for  tough combat encounters as each of its  individual parts increase the strength  of your attacks once the armour reaches  its tier to upgrade your charge attack  stamina tolerance increases allowing you  to charge or use the attack longer  depending on the weapon the zora armor  is the best set to equip while swimming  it greatly boosts your swimming speed  and when you upgrade the whole set twice  the stamina consumed by your - stroke is  decreased its helmet also allows you to  perform a spin attack while you're  swimming so you never have to worry  about those pesky water octoroks ever  again though lizalfos on the other hand  come on come on get closer you  the stealth armor is modeled after the  appearance of the classic sheikah clan  outfit worn by Sheik from The Legend of  Zelda Ocarina of Time the stealth boost  provided by its individual components  make it an invaluable armor set to use  when sneaking up on animals and enemies  it's tier to upgrade bonus also grants  you a movement speed bonus at nighttime  when you wear all three pieces in terms  of pure defense you might think that the  soldiers armor is the go-to set while  it's easy to assume this it's actually  the champions tunic that sports the  highest defense it's a pain to acquire  all the dragon shards needed to upgrade  the tunic but it's well worth the  trouble  plus the ability to see enemy HP is an  indispensable perk the ancient armor is  a handy set to wear went up against  Guardians as its parts offer you a  defensive boost against their  devastating laser blasts and when all of  its parts are upgraded twice the set  gives you an added proficiency with  ancient weapons which increases their  overall attack power  [Music]  the Thunder helm is a useful piece of  armor that you should take the time to  seek out it literally makes you immune  to lightning strikes and if you're  standing in water while being shocked  you won't be damaged either and it  doesn't cause you to drop your metal  equipment however if the enemy is  shooting electric arrows you will take  normal arrow damage so you should wear  some kind of armor with the Thunder helm  equipped you'll never have to worry  about thunderstorms or electrical  attacks ever again what are your  favorite armor sets let us know in the  comments below and for more coverage on  the legend of zelda wrath of the wild be  sure to subscribe to our YouTube channel  [Music]  you  [Music]
 

